        "detail": "（1）$\\frac{8}{15}-\\frac{1}{8}+\\frac{7}{15}-\\frac{3}{8}$<br>$=\\frac{8}{15}+\\frac{7}{15}-\\frac{1}{8}-\\frac{3}{8}$<br>$=1-\\frac{1}{8}-\\frac{3}{8}$<br>$=1-(\\frac{1}{8}+\\frac{3}{8})$<br>$=1-\\frac{1}{2}$<br>$=\\frac{1}{2}$<br>（2）$\\frac{1}{8}\\times \\frac{9}{7}+\\frac{5}{7}\\div 8$<br>$=\\frac{1}{8}\\times \\frac{9}{7}+\\frac{5}{7}\\times \\frac{1}{8}$<br>$=\\frac{1}{8}\\times (\\frac{9}{7}+\\frac{5}{7})$<br>$=\\frac{1}{8}\\times 2$<br>$=\\frac{1}{4}$<br>（3）$(\\frac{3}{4}+\\frac{7}{9}-\\frac{1}{2})\\times 3.6$<br>$=\\frac{3}{4}\\times 3.6+\\frac{7}{9}\\times 3.6-\\frac{1}{2}\\times 3.6$<br>$=2.7+2.8-1.8$<br>$=5.5-1.8$<br>$=3.7$<br>（4）$\\frac{7}{9}\\times [\\frac{2}{15}\\div (\\frac{5}{6}-0.25)]$<br>$=\\frac{7}{9}\\times [\\frac{2}{15}\\div (\\frac{5}{6}-\\frac{1}{4})]$<br>$=\\frac{7}{9}\\times [\\frac{2}{15}\\div (\\frac{10}{12}-\\frac{3}{12})]$<br>$=\\frac{7}{9}\\times [\\frac{2}{15}\\div \\frac{7}{12}]$<br>$=\\frac{7}{9}\\times [\\frac{2}{15}\\times \\frac{12}{7}]$<br>$=\\frac{7}{9}\\times \\frac{8}{35}$<br>$=\\frac{8}{45}$"
