        "detail": "（1）解：∵$3^{3}=27$，${(\\frac{1}{2})}^{4}=\\frac{1}{16}$，<br>∴$f(3,27)=3$，$f(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{1}{16})=4$，<br>故答案为：$3$，$4$．<br>（2）解：∵${(-3)}^{4}=81$，$5^{3}=125$，${(-\\frac{1}{3})}^{3}=-\\frac{1}{27}$，<br>∴$f(-3,81)=4$，$f(5,125)=3$，$f(-\\frac{1}{3},-\\frac{1}{27})=3$，<br>∴$f(-3,81)-f(5,125)-f(-\\frac{1}{3},-\\frac{1}{27})=4-3-3=-2$．<br>（3）解：∵$f(-\\frac{1}{2},a)=3$，<br>∴$a={(-\\frac{1}{2})}^{3}=-\\frac{1}{8}$，<br>∵${(-\\frac{1}{4})}^{2}=\\frac{1}{16}$，$f(-\\frac{1}{4},\\frac{1}{16})=b-1$，<br>∴$b-1=2$，<br>∴$b=3$，<br>∴$\\frac{b-2}{19b+7}=\\frac{3-2}{19\\times 3+7}=\\frac{1}{64}$，<br>又∵${(-\\frac{1}{8})}^{2}=\\frac{1}{64}$，<br>∴$f(a,\\frac{b-2}{19b+7})=f(-\\frac{1}{8},\\frac{1}{64})=2$．"
