        "detail": "解：$\\because \\angle 1=\\angle 2=\\angle BAC$，$\\angle 1=\\angle ABE+\\angle BAE$，$\\angle BAC=\\angle FAC+\\angle BAE$，$\\angle 2=\\angle ACF+\\angle FAC$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle BAE=\\angle ACF$，$\\angle ABE=\\angle FAC$，<br>在$\\triangle ABE$和$\\triangle CAF$中，<br>$\\begin{cases} \\angle BAE=\\angle ACF \\\\ AB=CA \\\\ \\angle ABE=\\angle FAC \\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\triangle ABE\\cong\\triangle CAF(\\text{ASA})$，<br>$\\therefore S_{\\triangle ABE}=S_{\\triangle CAF}$，<br>$\\because CD=2BD$，<br>$\\therefore S_{\\triangle ACD}=2S_{\\triangle ABD}$，<br>$\\because \\triangle ABC$的面积为$24$，<br>$\\therefore S_{\\triangle ACD}=\\frac{2}{3}S_{\\triangle ABC}=\\frac{2}{3}\\times 24=16$，$S_{\\triangle ABD}=\\frac{1}{3}S_{\\triangle ABC}=\\frac{1}{3}\\times 24=8$，<br>$\\because \\triangle BDE$的面积为$2$，<br>$\\therefore S_{\\triangle CAF}=S_{\\triangle ABE}=S_{\\triangle ABD}-S_{\\triangle BDE}=8-2=6$，<br>$\\therefore S_{\\triangle CFD}=S_{\\triangle ACD}-S_{\\triangle CAF}=16-6=10$．<br>故答案为：$10$．"
