        "detail": "解：$\\because \\angle ACB=90^\\circ$，<br>$\\therefore CE\\perp BC$，<br>又$\\because BE$平分$\\angle ABC$，$ED\\perp AB$，<br>$\\therefore CE=DE$，<br>$\\because BC=6,AB=10$，<br>$\\therefore \\frac{S_{\\triangle BCE}}{S_{\\triangle BAE}}=\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}BC\\cdot CE}{\\frac{1}{2}AB\\cdot DE}=\\frac{BC}{AB}=\\frac{6}{10}=\\frac{3}{5}$，<br>即$S_{\\triangle BCE}:S_{\\triangle BAE}=3:5$．<br>故选：B．"
