        "detail": "（1）证明：$\\because AD$平分$\\angle BAC$，$DE\\perp AB$于$E$，$DF\\perp AC$于$F$，<br>$\\therefore DE=DF$，$\\angle DEB=\\angle DFC=90^\\circ$，<br>在$\\text{Rt}\\triangle BED$和$\\text{Rt}\\triangle CFD$中，<br>$\\begin{cases} BD=CD \\\\ DE=DF \\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\text{Rt}\\triangle BED\\cong\\text{Rt}\\triangle CFD(\\text{HL})$，<br>$\\therefore BE=CF$．<br>（2）解：$\\because DE\\perp AB$，$DF\\perp AC$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle E=\\angle DFA=90^\\circ$，<br>在$\\text{Rt}\\triangle AED$和$\\text{Rt}\\triangle AFD$中，<br>$\\begin{cases} AD=AD \\\\ DE=DF \\end{cases}$，<br>$\\therefore \\text{Rt}\\triangle AED\\cong\\text{Rt}\\triangle AFD(\\text{HL})$，<br>$\\therefore AE=AF$，<br>$\\because \\text{Rt}\\triangle BED\\cong\\text{Rt}\\triangle CFD$，<br>$\\therefore CF=BE$，<br>$\\because AC=20$，$BE=4$，<br>$\\therefore AB=AE-BE=AF-CF=AC-CF-CF=20-4-4=12$．<br>$\\therefore$四边形$ABDC$的面积$=\\frac{1}{2}AC\\cdot DF+\\frac{1}{2}AB\\cdot DE=\\frac{1}{2}\\times 20\\times 8+\\frac{1}{2}\\times 12\\times 8=128$．"
