        "detail": "解：$\\because O$是$\\triangle ABC$三个内角平分线的交点，<br>$\\therefore$点$O$到$AB$、$BC$、$AC$的距离相等，<br>$\\because O$到边$AC$的距离为$4$，<br>$\\therefore O$到边$AB$、$BC$的距离都为$4$，<br>$\\therefore S_{\\triangle ABC}=\\frac{1}{2}AB\\times 4+\\frac{1}{2}AC\\times 4+\\frac{1}{2}BC\\times 4=36$，<br>$\\therefore AB+AC+BC=18$，<br>即$\\triangle ABC$的周长为$18$．<br>故选：C．"
