        "chapter": "15.3.1 等角对等边",
        "stem": "如图，已知$AB\\parallel CD$，$BC$平分$\\angle ABD$，交$AD$于点E．<br><img src=\"assets/images/img_docx_efe0e5512983.png\" data-cx=\"1962150\" data-cy=\"1047750\" style=\"width:206px;max-width:100%;height:auto\" class=\"inline-block align-middle my-1 rounded\"><br>(1)求证：$\\triangle BCD$是等腰三角形；<br>(2)若$AD\\perp BD$于点D，$\\angle CDA=28^\\circ$，求$\\angle 3$的度数．",
        "options": [],
