        "stem": "如图，在$\\triangle ABC$中$AD\\perp BC$于点$D$，$E$为$AC$上一点，连结$BE$交$AD$于点$F$，若$BF=AC$，$DF=DC$，则$\\angle 1$与$\\angle 2$的和为（   ）<br><img src=\"assets/images/img_docx_96561e6c6fe4.png\" data-cx=\"1352550\" data-cy=\"1190625\" style=\"width:142px;max-width:100%;height:auto\" class=\"inline-block align-middle my-1 rounded\">",
