        "detail": "解：∵点$A$坐标为$(-2,0)$，<br>$\\therefore OA=2$，<br>如图所示，过点$B$作$BC\\perp x$轴于$C$，<br>$\\because \\angle BAC=60^\\circ$，<br>$\\therefore \\angle ABC=30^\\circ$，<br>$\\therefore AC=\\frac{1}{2}AB=a$，<br>∴点$C$的横坐标是：$x_{A}+AC=-2+a$，<br>∴点$B$的横坐标为$-2+a$，<br>故选：A．"
